hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1427","On the authority of Yusuf bin Musa, on the authority of Jarir, on the authority of Mansour, on the authority of Al-Sha’bi, on the authority of Al-Bara’ ibn Azib, who said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, addressed us. On the Day of Eid al-Adha after the prayer, Abu Burdah ibn Nayyar said: I slaughtered my sheep and had lunch before I came to the prayer, so he said: “Your sheep is a meat sheep.” He mentioned the hadith. Abu Bakr said: I narrated it in the Book of Sacrifice."
